{"title": "Teenage Cricketer Makes History as India's Youngest International Debutant", "summary": "Vaibhav Sooryavanshi, a 15-year-old cricketer, made history by becoming India's youngest-ever international cricketer. He achieved this feat during his T20I debut against England, where he scored 14 runs and became the first Indian to be stumped on debut. This record surpasses Sachin Tendulkar's 36-year-old debut age record.", "summary_points": ["Vaibhav Sooryavanshi is India's youngest international cricketer at 15 years old.", "He achieved this feat during his T20I debut against England.", "Sooryavanshi scored 14 runs in his debut match and became the first Indian to be stumped on debut.", "This record surpasses Sachin Tendulkar's 36-year-old debut age record.", "The achievement marks a significant milestone in Sooryavanshi's cricketing career."], "title_hi": "15 वर्षीय क्रिकेटर ने भारत की सबसे छोटी अंतरराष्ट्रीय प्रतिभा बनाई", "summary_hi": "वैभव सूर्यवंशी 15 साल की उम्र में भारत की सबसे छोटी अंतरराष्ट्रीय क्रिकेट प्रतिभा बन गए। उन्होंने इंग्लैंड के खिलाफ अपने टी20आई डेब्यू में 14 रन बनाए और पहले भारतीय को डेब्यू पर स्टंप किया। इस रिकॉर्ड ने सचिन तेंदुलकर के 36 वर्ष पुराने डेब्यू उम्र रिकॉर्ड को तोड़ दिया है।", "summary_points_hi": ["वैभव सूर्यवंशी भारत की सबसे छोटी अंतरराष्ट्रीय क्रिकेट प्रतिभा बन गए हैं।"], "framing": {}, "framing_hi": {}, "topic": "Sports", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132107769,imgsize-42273.cms", "sources": [{"source": "The Times of India", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/india-tour-of-england/vaibhav-sooryavanshi-creates-history-breaks-sachin-tendulkars-36-year-old-record-ind-vs-eng-1st-t20i/articleshow/132107637.cms", "headline": "Historic! Sooryavanshi makes India debut, breaks Tendulkar's 36-year-old record"}, {"source": "National Herald", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Second T20I: Vau